# hll1 — counting unique visitors with HyperLogLog
#
# Learn: a set gives an exact unique count but grows with every member.
# A HyperLogLog (PFADD, PFCOUNT, PFMERGE) estimates the count with about
# 0.81% error in at most 12 KB, whether it has seen a thousand or a
# billion distinct items. It can't list its members.
#
# Task: visitors:2026-09-28 is already a HyperLogLog with about a
# thousand visitors. Record today's visitors (u1, u2, new1, new2) in
# visitors:2026-09-29, merge both days into visitors:week and print the
# estimated number of unique visitors for the week.
#

SADD visitors:2026-09-29 u1 u2 new1 new2
SUNIONSTORE visitors:week visitors:2026-09-28 visitors:2026-09-29
SCARD visitors:week
